                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Hold it - you just walked through my timing gate and cost me a personal best. I run data along this bend faster than the wire above it, and nobody crosses my split unmeasured."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I courier the numbers the towers cannot be trusted to carry. Up at dawn, back by dusk, overclocked in between - and you look like fresh latency. Draw."
                        }
